bin/

# Stray binaries from `go build ./cmd/<name>` WITHOUT -o, which writes the
# binary into the working directory. `make build` always passes -o bin/, so
# anything matching these names at the repo root is an accident — and two of
# them (36 MB, unstripped, with debug_info) were committed before this rule
# existed. The repo is public-mirrored; build artefacts must never ride along.
/heimdall-detect
/heimdall-analyst
/heimdall-bridge
/heimdall-notifier
/heimdall-ui
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.superpowers/
